      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hablemos",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800610062006C0065006D006F00730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué le pasa?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0051007500E90020006C006500200070006100730061003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Normalmente, el pelaje de un Wigglytuff es tan\nfino, suave y agradable al tacto que, si lo tocas,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nno puedes dejar de acariciarlo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 137
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sin embargo, el del mío... ¡Es espantoso y da\nmucho asco! ¡Lo voy a llamar Wigglytufo!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y para colmo, ¡odia las duchas a más no poder!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00590020007000610072006100200063006F006C006D006F002C002000A1006F0064006900610020006C006100730020006400750063006800610073002000610020006D00E100730020006E006F00200070006F006400650072002100100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero se me ha ocurrido una idea.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPodríamos simular un combate y que usen contra\nél Rayo Burbuja para dejarlo bien limpio.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 129
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Podrías meter en tu equipo a un Pokémon que\nconozca el movimiento Rayo Burbuja?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAvísame cuando lo hayas hecho, porfa.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 126
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mete en tu equipo a un Pokémon que conozca el\nmovimiento Rayo Burbuja.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Así dejaremos bien limpio a mi Wigglytuff!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 122
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qué bien, ¡llevas un Pokémon en tu equipo\nque conoce el movimiento Rayo Burbuja!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nVenga, hagamos como que combatimos.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 124
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡A limpiarlo se ha dicho!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100410020006C0069006D0070006900610072006C006F00200073006500200068006100200064006900630068006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Espera un momento",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007000650072006100200075006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bueno, pero no tardes, que mi Wigglytuff está\ndesaliñado y eso no puede ser.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por favor, deja a mi Wigglytuff resplandeciente\ncon un Rayo Burbuja o dos. O diez.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por favor, usa Rayo Burbuja contra mi Wigglytuff\npara dejarlo resplandeciente. ¡Te lo ruego!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wigglytuff, ¡qué limpito has quedado! Y ya no\napestas como antes, ¡qué bien!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Tuuufff!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005400750075007500660066006600210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A partir de ahora te lavaré cada cierto tiempo,\n¿me oyes?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410020007000610072007400690072002000640065002000610068006F007200610020007400650020006C006100760061007200E900200063006100640061002000630069006500720074006F0020007400690065006D0070006F002C000A00BF006D00650020006F007900650073003F00100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Wiggly!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10057006900670067006C0079002100100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wigglytuff propina un señor bofetón.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006900670067006C00790074007500660066002000700072006F00700069006E006100200075006E00200073006500F1006F007200200062006F00660065007400F3006E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¿Pero a qué viene eso?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100BF005000650072006F0020006100200071007500E90020007600690065006E0065002000650073006F003F002100100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿A lo mejor no se lavaba a propósito para que yo\ndejara de sobarlo tantísimo? ¿Le molestará?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oyeee, Wigglytuff, ¡espera, espera!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0079006500650065002C00200057006900670067006C00790074007500660066002C002000A1006500730070006500720061002C0020006500730070006500720061002100100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Volvemos a las andadas: un tufo que tira de\nespaldas y el agua ni olerla.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
